WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.040
¿Qué ocurre?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.280
Nothing’s wrong.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.400
Everything's okay.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:28.880
Robert.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.080
Hi, babe.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.240
Missed me?

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.440
Listen, I need your help.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:37.880
And I’m asking as an old friend.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.240
Old friend?

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.120
I’m intrigued.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.080
What do you want?

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:45.320
Do you remember when you said

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:46.360
that you knew the owner

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:47.760
of the strip club on Rose Street?

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.280
I need the security camera footage.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.840
Well, then I'll...

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.240
Robert, just can you arrange it or not?

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.800
Well, then

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.120
I’ll need something in return.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.200
Robert, not again…

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:05.920
Listen, just...

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.240
Just two of us, you and me.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.200
Okay?

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:10.040
Dinner.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.800
Nothing more. I promise.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.160
Fine.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:14.560
When do you want me to come

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:15.400
to your friend's club?

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:17.720
I'll be there too,

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:19.720
tomorrow evening - 7 p.m.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:20.960
Okay.
